The Vulkan decode attention shaders ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn_dec.comp and
flash_attn_dec_cm.comp follow the same structure (all GQA rows of a kv head per workgroup, keys split over
workgroups, dequantization at tile fill, split-K partials) as hipfire's kernels/src/attention_verify_wmma.gfx1100.hip
(Copyright (c) 2026 Ben1078, Apache-2.0, reference commit efa8fbb). They are new GLSL code; the attribution above applies.
ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn_dec_w.comp follows that kernel more closely (subgroup roles of query tile,
key half and dim half, Q^T fragments in registers, K and V^T planes filled in alternating phases, S^T exchange between
the dim halves, register softmax with a lazy rescale); it is new GLSL code for q4_0, and the same attribution applies.

